    "directions": [
      "Melt the butter over a low to medium flame.",
      "Sauté the onion and garlic.",
      "Add the chadon beni (culantro) and chive. Now add the tomatoes and let it cook in its own juices for about a minute…",
      "Add about 2 cups of water and a pinch of salt to taste.",
      "Then strain. The stock is now ready.",
      "Return the chicken stock to the pot on a medium flame. Add the potatoes, carrots and corn.",
      "When the potatoes are just about cooked add the ramen noodles and the rest of the chive.",
      "Stir until ramen is cooked. Season to taste ( salt, pepper etc.) Serve hot."
    ],
